    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1959-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Homo sapiens (human retinal arterial and microvascular bifurcation network) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 48.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-vascular-cube-law-branching-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1959-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching.py> ;
    schema:about "Homo sapiens (human retinal arterial and microvascular bifurcation network)" ;
