        "1959-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching.py L29–L32: Hardcoded scalar constants without parameter sweeps over alpha or gamma <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1959-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching.py#L29-L32>" ;
    pk:hasScore 4.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

